    $('#viewContainer').innerHTML=heading('快速录入','真实渠道优先；文件未提供渠道时才使用本批次默认值',`${btn('从文件读取','upload','quick-intake-file')}<input id="quickIntakeFile" type="file" accept=".csv,.tsv,.xlsx,.xls,.xlsm" hidden>${btn('清空','x','clear-intake')}`)+`<div class="intake-grid"><section class="panel intake-panel intake-input-panel"><div class="panel-headline"><strong>粘贴客户资料</strong><span>支持多行 / Excel</span></div><textarea id="intakeText" class="intake-textarea" placeholder="号码 姓名 渠道 页面 助理 群号&#10;98765 43210 Anita 单导 助理1351 小王 G001&#10;+91-98123-45678 Rahul 群粉 小李 G018">${esc(state.intakeText)}</textarea></section><section class="panel intake-panel intake-default-panel"><div class="panel-headline"><strong>本批次默认值</strong><span>仅填未填写项</span></div><div class="source-defaults"><label>渠道<select id="defaultSource">${sources.map(value=>`<option>${esc(value)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>页面<select id="defaultPage"><option value="">不分页面</option>${pages.map(value=>`<option>${esc(value)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>跟进助理<select id="defaultAssistant"><option>未分配</option>${assistants.filter(value=>value!=='未分配').map(value=>`<option>${esc(value)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>群编号<input id="defaultGroup" list="groupIdOptions" placeholder="例如 G001" /><datalist id="groupIdOptions">${groupIds.map(value=>`<option value="${esc(value)}"></option>`).join('')}</datalist></label><label class="intake-binary-default"><input id="defaultHot" type="checkbox"><span>热聊</span></label><label class="intake-binary-default"><input id="defaultInvestor" type="checkbox"><span>股民</span></label><details class="intake-advanced"><summary>高级设置</summary><div class="intake-advanced-fields"><label>未填写状态<select id="defaultStatus">${statuses.map(value=>`<option>${esc(value)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>登记日期<input id="defaultRegistered" type="date" value="${today}"><label class="manual-date-choice"><input id="manualRegistered" type="checkbox"><span>手动指定登记日期</span></label></label><label>客户阶段<select id="defaultPhase">${phases.map(value=>`<option>${esc(value)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>备注<input id="defaultNote" maxlength="500" placeholder="留空则使用资料中的备注"></label><div class="automation-switch"><span>自动创建首次跟进任务</span><button class="switch on" data-toggle aria-label="切换规则"></button></div></div></details></div><button class="btn primary intake-submit" data-action="save-intake">安全写入客户</button></section><section class="panel intake-panel intake-preview-panel"><div class="panel-headline"><strong>识别预览</strong><span>${rows.length} 行内容${rows.length>100?' · 展示前 100 行':''}</span></div><div class="parse-summary"><span class="parse-count good">可新增 ${good}</span><span class="parse-count warn">已存在 ${existing}</span><span class="parse-count bad">待检查 ${errors}</span></div><div class="preview-table-wrap"><table class="preview-table"><thead><tr><th>原始号码</th><th>标准号码</th><th>姓名</th><th>渠道</th><th>页面</th><th>助理</th><th>状态</th><th>群编号</th><th>登记日期</th><th>检查结果</th></tr></thead><tbody>${preview}</tbody></table></div></section></div>`;
