  function simpleCustomerTable(list,kind){const headers=['客户','号码','渠道','页面','跟进助理','客户阶段','计划日期','跟进内容','操作'];return `<section class="panel table-panel"><div class="table-toolbar"><div class="table-context"><strong>${kind==='follow'?'近期跟进计划':'客户明细'}</strong><span>${list.length} 条</span></div><label class="input-search">${icons('search')}<input data-search="module" placeholder="搜索客户"></label></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr>${headers.map(h=>`<th>${h}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${list.slice(0,100).map(c=>`<tr data-customer="${esc(c.id)}"><td><div class="customer-name-cell"><div class="mini-avatar">${esc(c.name[0])}</div><strong>${esc(c.name)}</strong></div></td><td class="phone-cell">${esc(c.rawPhone)}</td><td>${sourceTag(c.source)}</td><td>${esc(c.page||'—')}</td><td>${esc(c.assistant)}</td><td>${phaseTag(c.phase)}</td><td><span class="status-tag ${c.due<today?'tag-red':'tag-blue'}">${esc(c.due)}</span></td><td>${esc(c.note)}</td><td>${kind==='hot'?`<button class="table-action" data-action="toggle-hot" data-id="${esc(c.id)}">取消热聊</button>`:`<button class="table-action" data-action="follow" data-id="${esc(c.id)}">登记</button>`}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="table-footer"><span>本地查询 · ${list.length} 条记录</span>${btn('导出清单','download','export-filtered','small')}</div></section>`;}
